There's a difference. There will or will not be a portal to Fort Ludios
generated in a game, which is decided _once_ during startup of Nethack.
But as long as Demogorgon is not dead and the major demon summoners are
still not extinct or genocided Demogorgon may be summoned by some given
probability.

> Indeed, it is actually rather rare. Unfortunately for me, I 
> have had Demogorgon appear not once but twice in the sanctum level right 
