Just to prevent misunderstandings; as a unique demon Demogorgon _appears_
only once in every game. You may _kill_ him more than once in a game if
you, e.g., stone and then stone to flesh him. Bones levels with statues
are the only "exception" where he could (kind of) appear more than once;
summoned by a major demon and found as a statue (or possibly many statues
if there are more such insane bones levels loaded).

BTW, statues of Demogorgon seem to be generated as "historic statues" 8-)

